# Every pattern below is written with an explicit `**/` prefix so it matches at
# any depth and behaves the same in Docker and in the static check in
# tests/build-context.test.mjs.

# Dependencies: reinstalled inside the build stage from the lockfile.
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store

# Output of a local run. The image builds its own.
**/dist
**/.wrangler
**/.vinext
**/.next
**/out

# Local secrets and per-developer env files. `.env.example` and
# `.dev.vars.example` are only templates, but nothing at runtime needs them —
# excluding the whole family is the safer default.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars.*
**/*.pem

# Review and agent working material: screenshots, mailbox credentials,
# browser sessions, scratch scripts, partial downloads.
**/.review-tmp
**/.workbuddy
**/.agents
**/.codex
# .openai/hosting.json is imported by vite.config.ts at build time — keep it.
**/docs/visual-references
**/*.下载
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.git
